# Shared USE defaults for every gentoozinho profile. Both vm and desktop
# already inherit gentoo's targets/desktop (X, dbus, opengl, gtk, qt6, ...),
# so only what that target lacks goes here. Per-package flags live in
# package.use; anything a profile cannot carry is written to /etc/portage by
# install.sh.
USE="wayland pipewire vulkan bluetooth networkmanager dist-kernel"
